{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"forge_l1","model_identifier":"forge_l1","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# forge_l1\n\nCasting Hearth (forge level 1): an open stone hearth under a lean-to roof, clay crucibles in the coals, moulds and a water tub.\n\n- Footprint: 6 x 6 columns (96 x 96 units, 2.70 x 2.70 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -45..43, y 0..72, z -41..33 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 22, construction_0 21, construction_33 21, construction_66 24, ruined 14 (4 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 80 x 76 x 64 centred at the origin (open front)\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `forge_l1_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `forge_l1_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_forge_l1` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `working` | 1.6 | loop | `bellows` bellows pump. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `fx_flame` at (0, 22, 11)\n- `fx_smoke` at (0, 70, 11)\n- `slot_work` at (0, 0, -12)\n- `slot_dropoff` at (-30, 0, -40)\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"floor","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-40.0,0.0,-32.0],"to":[40.0,2.0,32.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,194.0,80.0,196.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.0,196.0,64.0,198.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,194.0,80.0,196.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.0,196.0,64.0,198.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[84.0,82.0,164.0,146.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[84.0,82.0,164.0,146.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"8207d6be-6976-5ab7-9c53-f9d3cb3ca704"},{"name":"post0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-36.0,0.0,-28.0],"to":[-32.0,60.0,-24.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[164.0,82.0,168.0,142.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[168.0,82.0,172.0,142.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[164.0,82.0,168.0,142.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[168.0,82.0,172.0,142.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[24.0,180.0,28.0,184.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[24.0,180.0,28.0,184.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"864c096d-7b00-5ac7-a961-25753aa26ec6"},{"name":"post1","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[32.0,0.0,-28.0],"to":[36.0,60.0,-24.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[172.0,82.0,176.0,142.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[168.0,82.0,172.0,142.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[172.0,82.0,176.0,142.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[168.0,82.0,172.0,142.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[28.0,180.0,32.0,184.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[28.0,180.0,32.0,184.0],"texture":0}},"typ